3
00:00:05,500 --> 00:00:07,900
Well, I think it looks like a golf ball.

4
00:00:07,900 --> 00:00:09,000
Tennis ball.

5
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:09,500
Golf ball.

6
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:10,300
Tennis ball!

7
00:00:10,300 --> 00:00:11,300
Golf ball!

8
00:00:11,300 --> 00:00:12,200
Bulleh.

9
00:00:12,200 --> 00:00:16,800
Oh my oxygen, Rocky has some serious vomiting issues.

10
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:19,000
Yeah, but when he has to barf,

11
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:21,200
