12
00:00:21,200 --> 00:00:22,500
Grr!

13
00:00:32,700 --> 00:00:35,900
Guys, why do you slap each other? It's pointless.

14
00:00:35,900 --> 00:00:37,500
He's a jerk.
He's a jerk.

15
00:00:47,500 --> 00:00:50,400
Hey, what is that speaker machine doing here?

16
00:00:50,400 --> 00:00:53,600
I'm here to remind you that your team, Another Name, lost.

17
00:00:53,600 --> 00:00:56,500
Let's go to the Cake at Stake place to see who'll be eliminated.

18
00:01:00,800 --> 00:01:10,000
[laughter]

19
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:12,500
The two of you with the most votes will leave the team.

20
00:01:12,500 --> 00:01:14,500
One will join the Cherries.

21
00:01:14,500 --> 00:01:16,300
The other will be eliminated.

22
00:01:16,300 --> 00:01:19,000
Golf Ball and Firey, you each have a Win Token.

23
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:20,300
Would you like to use it now?

24
00:01:20,300 --> 00:01:21,700
Hmm...

25
00:01:21,700 --> 00:01:24,700
Remember, if you use it, half of your votes will not count.

26
00:01:24,700 --> 00:01:25,600
I won't use it.

27
00:01:25,600 --> 00:01:27,500
Well, I will.

28
00:01:27,500 --> 00:01:29,200
Out of the total thirty-seven votes,

29
00:01:29,200 --> 00:01:30,600
