30
00:01:30,600 --> 00:01:31,800
Yay!

31
00:01:31,800 --> 00:01:34,300
But don't I also get some cake?

32
00:01:34,300 --> 00:01:36,700
A cake was too expensive, so we'll pretend.

33
00:01:36,700 --> 00:01:38,500
Here's an imaginary slice of cake.

34
00:01:38,500 --> 00:01:39,000
[splat]

35
00:01:39,000 --> 00:01:40,400
Firey is safe at three votes...

36
00:01:40,400 --> 00:01:40,900
Grr!

37
00:01:40,900 --> 00:01:42,200
...and Coiny is safe at five votes.

38
00:01:42,200 --> 00:01:43,500
Grr!

39
00:01:43,500 --> 00:01:46,900
Golf Ball and Rocky got twelve and fifteen votes, respectively.

40
00:01:46,900 --> 00:01:48,000
Even with her Win Token,

41
00:01:48,000 --> 00:01:49,500
Golf Ball's still in the top two.

42
00:01:49,500 --> 00:01:51,000
What!?

43
00:01:51,000 --> 00:01:54,500
Uh-oh, I'm left with the slappers!

44
00:01:54,500 --> 00:01:56,200
Golf Ball and Rocky,

45
00:01:56,200 --> 00:01:58,300
