46
00:01:58,300 --> 00:01:59,500
...or to be eliminated.

47
00:01:59,500 --> 00:02:03,200
So, yeah. I'd pick Rocky onto our team.

48
00:02:03,200 --> 00:02:05,200
GB is just a no-no!

49
00:02:05,200 --> 00:02:06,900
I'd say Rocky,

50
00:02:06,900 --> 00:02:09,400
