53
00:02:14,400 --> 00:02:15,900
I'd say Rocky,

54
00:02:15,900 --> 00:02:18,500
because Golf Ball's a bossy-bot.

55
00:02:18,500 --> 00:02:20,300
I'd say, like, Rocky,

56
00:02:20,300 --> 00:02:23,000
