66
00:02:45,400 --> 00:02:52,000
...to 0.000 percent!

67
00:02:52,000 --> 00:02:54,300
It's narrowed down to thirteen contestants.

68
00:02:54,300 --> 00:02:55,200
...a baker's dozen.

69
00:02:55,200 --> 00:02:57,300
I wonder where the new stairs lead.

70
00:02:57,300 --> 00:02:59,600
Well, in order for the next contest to start,

71
00:02:59,600 --> 00:03:01,000
