I...

74
00:03:06,900 --> 00:03:09,000
...I think this is the top.

75
00:03:09,000 --> 00:03:10,200
Whoa!

76
00:03:10,200 --> 00:03:11,000
Ha, ha.

77
00:03:11,000 --> 00:03:12,000
[♫]

78
00:03:12,000 --> 00:03:16,400
So, now that you're all up here except for that clumsy Tennis Ball,

79
00:03:16,400 --> 00:03:18,900
I want you to tie these balloons around your waists.

80
00:03:18,900 --> 00:03:21,600
[♫]

81
