83
00:03:24,100 --> 00:03:26,800
Yeah, I love magic tricks. Do it!

84
00:03:26,800 --> 00:03:28,000
Okay, here I go.

85
00:03:28,000 --> 00:03:28,900
Poof.

86
00:03:28,900 --> 00:03:29,500
[scream]

87
00:03:29,500 --> 00:03:30,800
...oh. Uh.

88
00:03:30,800 --> 00:03:31,800
Ha, ha.

89
00:03:31,800 --> 00:03:34,400
So the eleventh contest is to try to stay up in the air.

90
00:03:34,400 --> 00:03:36,000
Last team standing wins.

91
00:03:36,000 --> 00:03:37,600
Well, this should be easy.

92
00:03:37,600 --> 00:03:41,000
Oh yeah, over there is a basket of nails to throw at others.

93
00:03:41,000 --> 00:03:42,000
Help yourself and begin.

94
00:03:42,000 --> 00:03:44,300
Okay, I say we go for the Cherries.

95
00:03:44,300 --> 00:03:46,400
