Grr!

102
00:04:01,500 --> 00:04:04,000
Whoa!

103
00:04:04,000 --> 00:04:06,900
[screaming]

104
00:04:06,900 --> 00:04:08,000
[scream]

105
00:04:11,000 --> 00:04:13,000
Hi, TB.

106
00:04:13,000 --> 00:04:13,800
Whoa!

107
00:04:13,800 --> 00:04:15,500
[grunt]

108
