123
00:04:47,000 --> 00:04:48,100
Huh?

124
00:04:48,100 --> 00:04:55,000
Whoa!

125
00:04:56,000 --> 00:04:57,500
Yah.

126
00:04:57,500 --> 00:05:00,400
